Package: sweetsoursong
Title: Pollinator-Mediated Coexistence of Nectar Microbes
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(c("Lucas", "A."), "Nell", , "lucnell@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3209-0517")),
    person(c("Christopher", "A."), "Klausmeier", role = "aut",
           comment = "Model formulation and original Mathematica implementation"))
Description: Continuous-time Markov chain models of yeast, bacteria, and
    pollinators on flowering plants coupled through a regional pollinator
    pool. Computes stationary distributions of a reduced model with a
    vacancy closure, closed-metacommunity equilibria, invasion criteria,
    and the full per-plant model used as an accuracy check.
